### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix : <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:Scene1 a :AutonomousDrivingScene ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :Nighttime ;
    :hasLightingCondition :ArtificialLighting .

:EgoVehicle a :Vehicle ;
    :hasColor "Red" ;
    :hasPosition :LeftLane ;
    :isFollowing :YellowTaxi ;
    :hasOcclusion :YellowTaxi .

:YellowTaxi a :Vehicle ;
    :hasColor "Yellow" ;
    :hasLicensePlate "CARLA" ;
    :isAheadOf :EgoVehicle ;
    :hasBrakeLightsOn true ;
    :isInLane :LeftLane .

:RedVehicle a :Vehicle ;
    :hasColor "Red" ;
    :isNear :Sidewalk ;
    :hasPosition :FarRight .

:RoadMarkings a :RoadInfrastructure ;
    :hasType :DoubleYellowLines ;
    :hasType :DashedWhiteLines .

:Sidewalk a :RoadInfrastructure ;
    :isAdjacentTo :Road .

:Streetlights a :RoadInfrastructure ;
    :illuminates :Scene1 .

:Building a :RoadInfrastructure ;
    :isOn :RightSide .

:TrafficSign a :RoadInfrastructure ;
    :isOn :RightSide ;
    :hasVisibility :Low .
```

